# Stark Enterprises

Official company website and payment infrastructure.

## 🌐 Website

Main company site: https://stark-enterprises-two.vercel.app

## 💳 Payment Proxy

The `/pay` directory contains a payment proxy for WebToApp that routes Razorpay payments through this domain.

**Why?** `stark-enterprises-two.vercel.app` is whitelisted in Razorpay, allowing payments from `websitetoapp.app` to be processed through this proxy.

### Payment API Endpoints

- **Create Order**: `https://stark-enterprises-two.vercel.app/pay/api/razorpay/create-order`
- **Verify Payment**: `https://stark-enterprises-two.vercel.app/pay/api/razorpay/verify-payment`
- **Get Key**: `https://stark-enterprises-two.vercel.app/pay/api/razorpay/get-key`

